# Route: guide 9 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 27 to
# 31, 48 quests, 5.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Darkshore): Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery ->
# Darkshire -> Manor Mistmantle -> Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery ->
# The Rotting Orchard -> The Yorgen Farmstead -> Vul'Gol Ogre Mound -> Raven
# Hill -> The Hushed Bank -> Raven Hill Cemetery -> The Hushed Bank -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Bride of the Embalmer (253; Eliza
# 31).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 90 Seasoned
# Wolf Kabobs.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377).

